-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Rossi</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Filippelli</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Indomethacin potentiates acetylcholine-induced vasodilatation by increasing free radical production</article-title><source>Br J Pharmacol</source><year>2004</year><volume>142</volume><fpage>1233</fpage><lpage>1240</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15265802</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/sj.bjp.0705877</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Van Heiningen</surname><given-names>PN</given-names></name><name><surname>Van Zwieten</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Influence of the endothelium on Ca<sup>2+ </sup>dependency of angiotensin II-induced contractions of rat aortic rings</article-title><source>Fundam Clin Pharmacol</source><year>1993</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>227</fpage><lpage>233</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8370569</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Datt&#x000e9;</surname><given-names>JY</given-names></name><name><surname>Gohlke</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Pees</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Ziegler</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Short treatment of normotensive and hypertensive rat by angiotensin II and nitric oxide inhibitor induce increase of noradrenaline sensitivity in isolated portal vein preparations</article-title><source>Pharmacol Research</source><year>2000</year><volume>41</volume><fpage>641</fpage><lpage>647</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1006/phrs.1999.0635</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Van Rossum</surname><given-names/